<title>GERMANY: German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</title>
<headline>German ZEW details 6-mth major nations forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table lists the economic and market forecasts for the six months from March 19 issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute. The averages are compiled from a survey of 309 firms conducted from March 3-18.</p>
<p>					  Base    Forecast</p>
<p>INFLATION RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    1.8     1.9</p>
<p>    U.S.				 3.0     3.3</p>
<p>    Japan				0.1     0.3</p>
<p>    Britain			    2.4     2.7</p>
<p>    France			     1.6     1.7</p>
<p>    Italy				2.4     2.5</p>
<p>SHORT-TERM RATES</p>
<p>(Three-month interbank rates)</p>
<p>    Germany			    3.3     3.4</p>
<p>    U.S.				 5.1     5.7</p>
<p>    Japan				0.6     0.8</p>
<p>    Britain			    6.2     6.6</p>
<p>    France			     3.4     3.5</p>
<p>    Italy				7.3     7.3</p>
<p>LONG-TERM RATES</p>
<p>    Germany			    5.7     6.0</p>
<p>    U.S.				 6.7     7.2</p>
<p>    Japan				2.3     2.6</p>
<p>    Britain			    7.3     7.7</p>
<p>    France			     5.5     5.7</p>
<p>    Italy				7.7     7.9</p>
<p>BOURSE</p>
<p>    German DAX		     3,380   3,460</p>
<p>    U.S. Dow Jones		 6,970   6,960</p>
<p>    Japan Nikkei		  18,100  18,800</p>
<p>    Britain FT-SE 100	    4,410   4,400</p>
<p>    France CAC-40		  2,650   2,750</p>
<p>    Italy MIBtel		  11,900  12,500</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES V MARK</p>
<p>    Swiss franc		     1.16    1.15</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar		     1.70    1.76</p>
<p>    Japanese yen		    1.39    1.40</p>
<p>    British pound		   2.72    2.74</p>
<p>    French franc		    2.96    2.96</p>
<p>    Italian lira		    1.00    0.99</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
